# 统一换行：仓库内一律存 LF，检出时不改写。
# 缺少此文件时，Windows 贡献者的下一次提交会把每个文件都算成改动。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：不做换行转换，也不参与 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.node binary

# 锁文件与产物：diff 噪音大且无审阅价值
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff linguist-generated
